<title>POLAND: POLISH PEUGEOT-CITROEN UNIT ISSUES PLN 25 MLN CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH PEUGEOT-CITROEN UNIT ISSUES PLN 25 MLN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of France's Peugeot Citroen is offering 25 million zlotys worth of one-month commercial papers through the Polish branch of Societe Generale, a Societe Generale dealer said.</p>
<p>Bartlomiej Kumela told Reuters the bank was offering the paper, maturing October 31, 1996, with a yield of 18.75 percent.</p>
<p>The paper comes from a 30-million zloty borrowing programme managed jointly by Societe Generale and ING Bank Warsaw.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
